The backend images now generate the Zope configuration at container start with `cookiecutter-zope-instance` instead of the static `skeleton/` tree. The `etc/package-includes/*.zcml` and `etc/zope.conf.d/*.conf` drop-ins are removed — use `INSTANCE_zcml_package_includes`, a mounted `instance.yaml`, or `wsgi_filters` instead. See the migration guide (`docs/migration-cookiecutter-zope-instance.md`).
